diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 5fb5fbf..cd71886 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- The table of contents lists heading levels 1 and 2 by default (`toc_max_level` was 3).
 - Double quotes in text content are no longer written as `&quot;`; attribute values still escape them.
 - Heading ids and table of contents anchors now start with the `id_prefix` option, `section-` by default.
 
